+#
+# Betterlife BL3676 touchscreen
+#
+config TOUCHSCREEN_BETTERLIFE_TS
+	tristate "Betterlife BL3676 touchscreen driver"
+	depends on INPUT && I2C
+	default n
+	help
+	  Betterlife BL3676 (board p1_nor_XYC_K1). Compatible "BTL,betterlife_ts".
